00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:04.944
So if you're going to run your agent here,
make sure that you're using

185
00:09:04.944 --> 00:09:07.947
your newly created start main span method

186
00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.783
and you can run that.

187
00:09:10.783 --> 00:09:12.752
But if you switch over into Phoenix,

188
00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:15.755
